OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after man stabbed by
OL,4,Agroup in balaclavas
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurdering a man who was stabbed to
OL,8,Fdeath in Manchester.
OL,10,FA 27-year-old man was stabbed several
OL,11,Ftimes on Moss Bank in Crumpsall shortly
OL,12,Fafter 01:30 GMT on Saturday and died in
OL,13,Fan ambulance from his injuries, Greater
OL,14,FManchester Police (GMP) said.
OL,16,FThe force said the victim had been
OL,17,Fattacked by "a number of males", all
OL,18,Fbelieved to have been wearing dark
OL,19,Fclothing and balaclavas.
